# CODEOWNERS for the golden-records commons repository.
#
# This file governs review/approval for changes to the COMMONS itself
# (template logic, copier.yml schema, CI, shared policy language). It is
# intentionally distinct from any individual adopting organization's board
# of directors or internal approval chain — those are configured separately
# in each organization's *rendered* copy after `copier copy`/`copier update`.
#
# @US-Council/maintainers is a placeholder team. Replace with the actual
# commons maintainer team handle once the US-Council GitHub organization
# and team are provisioned.

* @US-Council/maintainers

# The Copier question schema and leak-guard are especially sensitive —
# changes here affect every downstream adopter and the anti-leak safety net.
/copier.yml               @US-Council/maintainers
/.gitleaks.toml            @US-Council/maintainers
/.gitleaks-denylist.txt    @US-Council/maintainers
/.github/workflows/        @US-Council/maintainers
